# Commit, rebuild, reinstall

After finishing a set of code changes in this repo (unless the user says not to):

1. Create a git commit for the changes (follow the repo commit protocol / HEREDOC message style).
2. Rebuild and reinstall with `cargo install --path . --force`.

Do this at the end of each change set without waiting to be asked.
